  <name>Tunnelbird</name>
  <summary>Connect to your VPN in one click</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="fr">Connectez-vous à votre VPN en un clic</summary>
  <developer id="fr.ferhatsn">
    <name>Ferhat Saidoun</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Tunnelbird imports the .conf or .ovpn file from your VPN provider or your
      own server, and connects in one click. It works with the network settings of
      your system and never needs administrator rights.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>WireGuard® tunnels and OpenVPN profiles</li>
      <li>Preview and edit a tunnel before saving it, with clear errors</li>
      <li>One tunnel at a time: switching disconnects the previous one</li>
      <li>Live traffic graph, public IP address, country and city</li>
      <li>Warns when the server stops answering or the tunnel drops</li>
      <li>Connects by itself on untrusted Wi-Fi, never on your own networks</li>
      <li>Top bar icon to switch tunnels without opening the window</li>
      <li>Share a tunnel as a file or as a QR code for your phone</li>
      <li>Recognises well-known VPN providers</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">fr.ferhatsn.Tunnelbird.desktop</launchable>
